# Geometry Final Exam Study Guide

## 1. Reasoning, Lines and Transformations
**Standards:** G.RLT.1, G.RLT.2, G.RLT.3
**Skills:** 10

### Key Concepts:
- [u]Understanding geometric reasoning[/u]
- [c]Properties of lines and angles[/c]
- [b]Types of transformations[/b] (translation, rotation, reflection, dilation)

### Diagram: Lines, Angles, and Transformations
