### Practice Problems:
1. Identify the types of angles formed by a transversal intersecting two parallel lines.
2. Describe the effect of a 90° rotation on a given point.
3. Determine if two lines are parallel based on their slopes.

## 2. Triangles
**Standards:** G.TR.1, G.TR.2, G.TR.3, G.TR.4
**Skills:** 20

### Key Concepts:
- [h]Triangle properties[/h] (sum of angles, Pythagorean theorem)
- [c]Congruence criteria[/c] (SSS, SAS, ASA, AAS, HL)
- [b]Similarity criteria[/b] (AA, SAS, SSS)
- [u]Special triangles[/u] (30-60-90, 45-45-90, equilateral, isosceles)

