- [h]Polygon properties[/h] (interior/exterior angles, diagonals)
- [c]Circle properties[/c] (radius, diameter, circumference, area)
- [b]Special polygons[/b] (regular, irregular, convex, concave)
- [u]Circle theorems[/u] (central angle, inscribed angle, arc length)

